{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "F1",
      "statement": "Scope: the run record (run:72cf0e4b91a3) is a bounded replay of 55 events. clink exited with status 0, 3 of 3 jobs completed, and the run was not cancelled. Parameters: fan_in_min_senders=5, fan_in_window_ms=3600000, onward_max_gap_ms=1800000. The graph holds 55 transfers, 48 accounts, 35 devices, 14 onward links and 2 fan-in alerts. Everything below holds only for this dataset as processed by this run.",
