      "statement": "Alert fan_in:A-9278:1794301200000: account A-9278, window 1794301200000–1794304800000. 6 distinct senders, 6 transfers, total 357000 minor units. Contributing transfers: T0002 (A-4452, 42000), T0003 (A-4366, 61500), T0006 (A-7266, 38000), T0010 (A-8133, 89000), T0011 (A-6801, 50500) and T0012 (A-3881, 76000). Each was sent from a different device.",
