    {
      "id": "F4",
      "statement": "Onward links for A-9278: all 6 contributing transfers are passed on, at most 3 links deep, along A-9278 -> A-5092 -> A-2897 -> A-4989, in two waves. Wave 1: T0002, T0003 and T0006 link to T0007 (A-9278 to A-5092, 138000), then T0008 (A-5092 to A-2897, 135000), then T0009 (A-2897 to A-4989, 132000). Wave 2: T0010, T0011 and T0012 link to T0014 (A-9278 to A-5092, 210000), then T0015 (A-5092 to A-2897, 206000), then T0016 (A-2897 to A-4989, 202000). Neither T0009 nor T0016 is passed on, so the money comes to rest at A-4989 only. Each hop pays out a little less than it received.",
