    {
      "id": "F5",
      "statement": "Onward links for A-9895: only 3 of the 6 contributing transfers (T0038, T0039, T0040) are passed on, each by one link to T0041 (A-9895 to A-1415, 14000). T0035, T0036 and T0037 are not passed on; their credit-to-debit gaps to T0041 exceed the 1800000 ms limit. T0041 is not passed on either, so the most links in any chain is 1 and the money comes to rest at A-1415. A-1415's later send T0055 is not recorded as an onward link of T0041.",
